      <blockquote class="boiler">Last Soul Ultra is a backyard ultramarathon founded by Kim Gottwald. Runners complete a 6.706 km loop every hour, on the hour, until one is left. The 2026 edition was won by Mark Dowdle at 94 yards, the furthest a backyard ultra has gone on German soil. The Last Soul Ultra World Series runs qualifiers in the USA, the UK and Australia, leading to one final in Germany.</blockquote>
